  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nGlow is a minimalist preset designed to soften any scene with a touch of warmth. Its subtle adjustments create a natural, pleasing look, perfect for showing models how great they look right from the back of the camera. By adding gentle warmth and softening the overall image, this recipe can enhance your photos as you shoot, making it ideal for on-the-spot custom Picture Control. It's perfect for a smoother, warmer aesthetic without overpowering the scene.",
